    "short": "AI grounding layer for finance: markets, filings, earnings and news, all cited",
    "full": "Bigdata.com brings institutional research infrastructure to Microsoft Copilot: SEC filings, earnings transcripts, broker research, financial statements and estimates, sentiment signals, macro data, and premium news. RavenPack's financial knowledge graph resolves entities and grounds every claim in a source citation. Ask in plain language to build an initiation report, compare two 10-Ks, or run a pre-FOMC briefing. Built for analysts at hedge funds, asset managers, and investment banks.\n\nTo use this app, you need an active Bigdata.com account.\n\nSign up: https://app.bigdata.com/\nGet started and help: https://docs.bigdata.com/mcp-reference/introduction\nSupport: support@bigdata.com"
  },
